We have multiple separate DndContext instances when we need a single shared one. The modal has its own DndContext and the preview panel (via TrackListContainer) has its own DndContext, so they can't communicate.

The solution is to:

Create a single shared DndContext at the PlaylistMixer level that wraps both the preview and modals

Remove the individual DndContext instances from TrackSourceModal and TrackListContainer

Make the preview panel a droppable target that can accept tracks from the modal sources